# Copy this file, uncomment the entries, and replace them with your peer IDs.
#
# One entry per line: either "peer_id" or "peer_id,name".
# Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
# Lines with no name fall back to --name-template, if given.
#
# The examples below are commented out on purpose. Every line in this file is
# a commented example, so running the file as-is registers nothing — a valid
# peer ID that is not yours would still bond 100,000 SQD if it were sent.
#
# The IDs are real, decodable ed25519 identity multihashes, so they show the
# exact shape a line needs; they are still placeholders, not your nodes.
#
